Fix security vulnerabilities in PduParser.java

CVE-Info: CVE-2026-58865 | Severity: Critical | Type: DoS

- Fix ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException in parseContentType by adding bounds check for PduContentTypes.contentTypes index.
- Fix NullPointerExceptions in parseContentTypeParams by adding null checks for map and charsetStr.

